   "note": "SELECTED, NOT DESIGNED. A population of layered recipes over the open English voices was bred and measured (intelligibility, presence against a target three quarters of the way from NEURAL to JAIMLA, timbre, efficiency, fidelity); only the fittest survived. NEURAL and JAIMLA are the set-in-stone references it is measured against, not its material. The in-house extrapolation is the alternate: press SAVANTE again.",
