    "sentenceSilence": 0.55,
    "measured": "the octave below is measured per render; the harmony report is in the manifest",
    "note": "EVERY LESSON IN THIS FILE, IN ONE VOICE, AND IT IS FROM JAIMLA. She is the first voaice, so she is the body — not a ratio on the reference, because a ratio on a male voice does not make a woman and never did. What is new is what surrounds her. From OVERLORD: the male-to-female ratio, 1.00 to 0.62. From LEADER: that a dry overlay is a second speaker, so the male half is entirely IN ECHO — four taps at 29 ms, nothing dry — and is heard as her own depth. From the harmony work: the interval is MEASURED per render and pulled onto a true octave BELOW her, which is the inverse of OVERLORD and is why SAVANTE sounds grounded where OVERLORD sounds spoken-about. From ANCIENT: the reading opens and closes in breath, here in a female whisper, so she arrives rather than switches on. A savant does not raise her voice; everything that would have been volume is depth instead."
