 "note": "SAVANTE, said sav-ont: the voice that reads for mindX and DeltaVerse, and on rage.pythai.net the articles on Savante. SELECTED, NOT DESIGNED: bred from the open voices of PYTHAI/voaice and kept by survival of the fittest (intelligibility, presence toward a target three quarters of the way from NEURAL to JAIMLA, timbre, efficiency, fidelity). Measured here at f0 150.0 Hz against that 148.7 Hz target. THIS PRINT FINGERPRINTS A RENDER, not the sAGI identity: cryptoAGI/savante canon/sAGI.voaice keeps vprint and measured null on purpose, because filling an identity from a synthesiser would be a voiding edit. The previous SAVANTE (JAIMLA with NEURAL an octave down, in echo, 2026-09-23) is kept in the store as audio/voices/savante.v1.*."
